 build only, not a standard support weapon."},{"name":"Prototype Starglitter","text":"ER stat stick when stronger support options are unavailable."}],"a":[{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Team ATK buff after Burst. Choose when she can Burst consistently.","stats":"HP%/ER · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Song of Days Past"],"text":"Converts healing into extra damage; useful when Noblesse is covered.","stats":"HP%/ER · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"text":"Personal Pyro and reaction damage set. Only for a dedicated quickswap damage build.","stats":"ATK% · Pyro DMG · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Shock and Awe","members":["Chevreuse","Cyno","Durin","Fischl"],"text":"Cyno leads Electro damage, Fischl adds off-field Electro, and Durin supplies Pyro. Chevreuse provides healing, ATK buffs, and RES shred.","roles":["Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Emotional Overload","members":["Chevreuse","Varesa","Mavuika","Iansan"],"text":"Varesa drives Electro damage with Mavuika’s Pyro and Iansan’s ATK buff. Chevreuse heals and reduces Pyro and Electro resistance.","roles":["Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Shots Fired","members":["Chevreuse","Arlecchino","Fischl","Durin"],"text":"Arlecchino leads Pyro damage while Fischl and Durin add off-field pressure. Chevreuse supplies buffs, healing, and RES shred.","roles":["Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Inazu-watt?","members":["Chevreuse","Raiden Shogun","Xiangling","Bennett"],"text":"Raiden batteries Xiangling’s Pyro Burst. Bennett boosts ATK and heals, while Chevreuse adds Overloaded-based RES shred.","roles":["Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]}],"v":"40K HP Support: Reach up to 40,000 HP to maximize her ATK buff while providing healing.\nQuickswap Pyro Damage: Trade some HP-based support strength for personal Skill and Burst damage.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Chevreuse buffs Pyro and Electro teams by reducing enemy resistance after Overloaded. She also provides ATK buffs and healing. Aim for 40,000 HP on support builds; a damage-focused build is optional.","pros":["Strong Buffs","Resistance Shred","Team Healing","Overload Support"],"cons":["Pyro/Electro teams only","Needs Overloaded","HP investment","Burst optional for support"],"weapons":["Symphonist of Scents","Favonius Lance","Black Tassel","Dialogues of the Desert Sages","Rightful Reward","Staff of Homa","Staff of the Scarlet Sands","Prototype Starglitter"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best overall"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Sub DPS"}],"main":["HP% / ER","HP%","HP% / Healing / CR"],"stats":["HP: Up to 40K","ER: If using Burst","CR: Favonius only"],"vars":[{"title":"40K HP Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Black Tassel","Dialogues of the Desert Sages"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / HP% / HP%; ER if Bursting; CR with Favonius.","teams":"Only Pyro and Electro; trigger Overloaded for RES shred.","when":"Reach up to 40,000 HP to maximize her ATK buff while providing healing.","cond":"No need to Burst every rotation","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Quickswap Pyro Damage","role":"Sub DPS","weapons":["Staff of Homa","Staff of the Scarlet Sands","Favonius Lance"],"arts":[{"sets":["Crimson Witch of Flames"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Pyro DMG / CRIT; balance ER.","teams":"Pyro and Electro team that can spare field time for her.","when":"Trade some HP-based support strength for personal Skill and Burst damage.","cond":"Below 40K HP reduces her ATK buff","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Agnidus Agate Sliver","Agnidus Agate Fragment","Agnidus Agate Chunk","Agnidus Agate Gemstone","Fontemer Unihorn","Teachings of Order","Guide to Order","Philosophies of Order","Meshing Gear","Mechanical Spur Gear","Artificed Dynamic Gear","Lumidouce Bell","Lightless Eye